# Sandbox = ad-hoc developer scripts (per-session, not versioned).
# The proper workspace for an agent's sandbox is data/workspaces/<sid>/sandbox/
# (see CLAUDE.md "Per-session sandbox"). The /sandbox at the repo root is for
# the operator's throwaway scripts during development.
/sandbox/

# Unsorted screenshots at repo root — kept ignored so screenshots from
# ad-hoc browser sessions don't accidentally bloat the repo. Move
# campaign-relevant screenshots into audit/screenshots/ to commit them.
/*.png

# Husky generated helpers (the .husky/pre-commit hook itself IS versioned;
# the _ subdirectory is regenerated by `husky install`).
.husky/_/
